WEBVTT

00:02.590 --> 00:04.057
Legend has it...

00:05.226 --> 00:08.024
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.362 --> 00:13.527
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.169 --> 00:20.129
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.487 --> 00:40.916
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.195 --> 00:47.031
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.569 --> 00:54.474
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.143 --> 00:59.909
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:00.014 --> 01:03.211
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.987 --> 01:14.052
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.228 --> 01:20.064
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:20.935 --> 01:28.205
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.375 --> 01:36.783
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.484 --> 01:39.145
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.896 --> 01:52.332
<i>The Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

02:10.250 --> 02:11.444
She went that way!

02:14.755 --> 02:16.450
We must capture her at all costs!

02:31.171 --> 02:32.069
There she is!

02:32.606 --> 02:36.565
<i>Blast of the
Sickle-and-Chain</i>

03:09.276 --> 03:10.436
W-What the hell?

03:28.762 --> 03:31.822
D-Don't let her escape! Go after her!

03:33.033 --> 03:33.761
Right!

03:35.369 --> 03:36.734
What the hell do you think you're doing?

03:37.638 --> 03:40.471
Are you aware that we are
members of the Tateshina Clan?

04:14.141 --> 04:18.134
Please return to the castle...

04:18.545 --> 04:19.569
Stay away from me!

04:20.514 --> 04:21.606
In that case...

04:24.384 --> 04:25.544
Please forgive me!

04:48.575 --> 04:49.701
Lord Shishido...

04:49.910 --> 04:53.311
We never asked you to rescue
people during your journey...

04:53.747 --> 04:56.079
I haven't the slightest
intention of doing so.

04:56.950 --> 04:58.747
But I knew you wanted
a first-hand look...

04:58.852 --> 04:59.841
Sure, you hired me...

04:59.953 --> 05:03.252
...but weren't you wondering how
effective this sickle-and-chain was?

05:03.490 --> 05:05.287
What? No...

05:05.425 --> 05:07.655
So, are you dissatisfied?

05:08.595 --> 05:09.926
What power...

05:10.063 --> 05:13.794
I'm sure that even Musashi Miyamoto
won't be a match for such a weapon!

05:24.278 --> 05:25.745
Master!

05:25.846 --> 05:29.976
We're not far from our lodgings in
Kuwana, but it's starting to get dark.

05:30.083 --> 05:31.175
Are you tired?

05:31.285 --> 05:34.482
N-Not on your life! Come on,
this is a warrior's pilgrimage!

05:34.588 --> 05:35.680
Give me a break!

05:36.790 --> 05:38.485
Fresh clams!

05:38.759 --> 05:40.192
Fresh clams!

05:40.661 --> 05:43.858
Fresh clams!

05:44.598 --> 05:46.088
Clams, huh?

05:46.200 --> 05:48.168
Broiled clams would taste great now!

05:51.205 --> 05:53.036
Clam broth over here, huh?

05:53.140 --> 05:54.471
Yummy!

05:56.043 --> 05:57.840
Smells so good!

06:01.081 --> 06:02.048
Master?

06:03.383 --> 06:05.374
Master!

06:08.255 --> 06:09.449
There he is!

06:10.657 --> 06:12.352
Hey, that was close!

06:12.559 --> 06:15.858
The Master was just about to ditch me!

06:31.411 --> 06:32.435
Where am I?

06:34.815 --> 06:36.544
So you've regained consciousness...

06:37.084 --> 06:39.348
Your clothes are dry now.

06:41.722 --> 06:44.748
Oh, please, take your time...

06:45.959 --> 06:47.620
You've been looking after me, I see.

06:59.873 --> 07:01.704
Well! How are you feeling?

07:06.179 --> 07:08.374
You're not putting us through any trouble.

07:08.515 --> 07:10.847
As you can see, this is
just a humble little shack.

07:11.151 --> 07:13.176
We can offer little in
the way of hospitality...

07:13.320 --> 07:15.254
All right, why don't we have dinner now?

07:16.189 --> 07:18.657
The rapeseed buds are starting to bloom.

07:18.759 --> 07:22.525
Then we might be able to
harvest the oil this fall...

07:22.629 --> 07:25.063
Well, I'm sure it won't be much.

07:25.565 --> 07:28.295
Oh, I should tell you, we've got
beautiful cherry blossoms here...

07:28.402 --> 07:30.768
Why aren't you asking any questions?

07:36.343 --> 07:39.540
You don't have to tell us anything.

07:39.913 --> 07:42.711
Please, have some more food!

07:57.931 --> 07:59.489
I'm indebted to you both.

08:05.706 --> 08:07.640
You're not well enough
yet to be walking.

08:09.576 --> 08:13.603
If I stay here, I might very
well bring you trouble.

08:14.281 --> 08:16.681
I'm a fugitive...

08:18.085 --> 08:19.484
Please, just come inside...

08:20.220 --> 08:22.950
When my uncle found
out that I wasn't a man...

08:23.190 --> 08:26.159
...he tried to use me
as a political tool.

08:26.393 --> 08:29.521
He tried to force me
into a strategic marriage.

08:30.364 --> 08:35.563
My guardian did everything he
could to put a stop to those plans...

08:43.310 --> 08:48.145
But then his illness took a turn for
the worse, and he died this winter.

08:49.416 --> 08:53.375
Jii's fervent wish was to
reinstate me as ruler of my clan...

08:55.021 --> 08:57.854
But I suppose that
was just a pipe dream...

08:59.226 --> 09:04.163
And so I wanted to
escape from such a place...

09:06.433 --> 09:10.836
Miss Shiori, the truth
is, I was once a samurai...

09:11.738 --> 09:15.697
Asanosuke renounced his position
as a samurai so he could marry me...

09:17.043 --> 09:19.170
He renounced his position?

09:19.579 --> 09:20.477
Yes.

09:21.314 --> 09:24.772
There was no other way
that I could be with O-Ume.

09:25.585 --> 09:26.984
That was all...

09:27.954 --> 09:32.448
Miss Shiori, everyone has their
own reasons for doing something...

09:32.959 --> 09:36.656
Don't you think that it would be
wrong to simply accept your fate?

09:38.365 --> 09:40.424
You must run away, as far as you can go...

09:41.101 --> 09:44.832
There's no shame in living
life on your own terms.

09:44.938 --> 09:47.839
I'm sure that's what your
guardian wants you to do...

09:47.941 --> 09:52.275
We can't really be of much assistance
to you, but this is a secluded shack.

09:52.379 --> 09:56.907
Surely it wouldn't be easy for
your pursuers to find you here.

09:57.317 --> 09:59.842
If you don't mind being
in such humble quarters...

09:59.953 --> 10:02.888
...you're free to stay here until
you're well enough to travel.

10:13.934 --> 10:15.299
Are you going, then?

10:16.336 --> 10:18.463
I thought you were
planning to defeat Munenori...

10:18.572 --> 10:21.063
...and take over as
instructor to the Shogun...

10:21.408 --> 10:24.036
It all seems so meaningless now!

10:26.580 --> 10:28.013
Then where are you headed?

10:28.482 --> 10:31.747
Searching for worthy opponents,
just as I've been doing until now.

10:32.319 --> 10:36.221
If I seek out the powerful, then
I'll be sure to run into that one.

10:37.057 --> 10:38.081
That one?

10:38.892 --> 10:39.881
Yakumo...

10:40.460 --> 10:41.893
Yakumo Mutsu.

10:42.996 --> 10:45.692
A man worthy of such
respect from Musashi?

10:45.832 --> 10:48.733
I'd like to meet him myself!

10:55.008 --> 10:56.532
Look, Miss Shiori!

10:56.643 --> 10:58.941
I've picked all this
bracken and royal fern...

11:05.318 --> 11:07.479
You'll make a fine woman for sure.

11:09.289 --> 11:10.722
Yakumo...

11:25.572 --> 11:28.006
Time to eat!

12:33.573 --> 12:37.373
Young man, have you spent a
lot of time training in Zen?

12:37.510 --> 12:38.204
Huh?

12:39.613 --> 12:42.411
I have to say, you have
quite formidable skills.

12:42.716 --> 12:45.014
I daresay you are well-grounded
in the martial arts.

12:45.752 --> 12:47.913
Nothing as clever as that.

12:48.254 --> 12:51.985
The only skills I've mastered have to
do with killing others, nothing more.

12:54.894 --> 12:56.919
Hey, go gather up some twigs, will you?

12:58.198 --> 12:59.290
Twigs?

13:00.400 --> 13:04.268
See, I'm not so well off that I
can afford to let you eat for free.

13:10.210 --> 13:11.472
So good!

13:17.784 --> 13:19.251
Boy, I'm stuffed.

13:19.919 --> 13:21.045
All right, then...

13:23.356 --> 13:24.914
So, are you off now?

13:25.125 --> 13:25.853
Yes.

13:26.226 --> 13:27.693
Well, then, me too.

13:28.995 --> 13:30.690
Thank you for the meal.

13:40.273 --> 13:44.073
All right, now I've got to find Musashi!

14:01.494 --> 14:03.086
So that's Musashi, eh?

14:13.540 --> 14:16.202
Master, let's stop here for the night!

14:17.744 --> 14:19.109
Welcome!

14:19.212 --> 14:20.941
Two guests have arrived!

14:21.047 --> 14:22.571
I hope you had a good journey.

14:22.816 --> 14:24.044
I'm starving!

14:24.451 --> 14:25.850
We want dinner right away!

14:26.052 --> 14:27.883
Are you Mr. Miyamoto?

14:28.088 --> 14:29.112
Yes...

14:29.622 --> 14:32.090
Someone outside wanted to give you this...

14:34.160 --> 14:35.559
A letter of challenge...

14:36.963 --> 14:38.988
Master, what's wrong?

14:40.533 --> 14:41.522
Nothing.

14:48.908 --> 14:50.136
This is great!

14:51.845 --> 14:55.975
Master, I finally found you
after you left me in Kokura...

14:56.082 --> 15:00.109
...but the second I'm off guard you're
planning to abandon me again, aren't you?

15:02.188 --> 15:06.625
You did make me your disciple
back in Kokura, remember?

15:08.027 --> 15:10.359
I want to become as
strong as you, Master...

15:10.463 --> 15:12.693
I want to become the
greatest swordsman in Japan!

15:12.799 --> 15:14.926
So please, I want you to train me!

15:16.169 --> 15:17.693
Go back to Kokura.

15:18.671 --> 15:20.468
Oh, come on, Master!

15:22.175 --> 15:23.107
Time to sleep.

15:42.095 --> 15:48.625
Iori, my own training is still incomplete,
so I cannot be your teacher now...

15:49.636 --> 15:51.126
Wait for me in Kokura...

15:52.272 --> 15:54.706
Don't abandon me...

15:58.311 --> 16:00.677
Master...

16:11.024 --> 16:13.492
Thought you'd make a
run for it, Musashi?

16:21.067 --> 16:23.160
I am Baiken Shishido.

16:23.536 --> 16:24.662
Fight me now!

16:25.705 --> 16:29.641
I appreciate your challenge, but I don't
want to engage in meaningless duels.

16:29.742 --> 16:30.674
What?

16:31.110 --> 16:33.544
I don't want to kill you, that's all.

16:44.390 --> 16:47.621
Who can say which one of us will
be killed unless we actually fight?

17:01.407 --> 17:03.034
Musashi...

17:31.838 --> 17:34.033
Even stronger than rumored?

18:32.131 --> 18:35.066
Well, now, I'd like to
see you get out of this!

18:38.037 --> 18:39.504
Die!

18:42.375 --> 18:42.932
What?

19:03.596 --> 19:04.654
What power!

19:04.764 --> 19:06.254
What power...

19:06.499 --> 19:10.367
No one but Musashi Miyamoto
himself could've done it...

19:11.204 --> 19:12.364
Is that you, Osho?

19:13.206 --> 19:16.300
Nothing is more sacred to
a samurai than his daito...

19:16.409 --> 19:19.276
Yet you tossed it aside
without hesitation...

19:19.746 --> 19:23.182
No ordinary swordsman
could've done that.

19:23.416 --> 19:28.046
I suppose Munenori was wise to evade you.

19:28.554 --> 19:31.921
I must say, you are almost too powerful!

19:32.658 --> 19:35.525
Can't you rein it in a bit?

19:38.297 --> 19:43.132
Your sword is like something that
tries to cut down the heavens above...

19:43.369 --> 19:46.429
But even if you raise
your sword to the heavens...

19:46.672 --> 19:51.871
You can't cut down
those clouds going by.

19:53.646 --> 19:56.615
Osho, where did you meet him?

19:58.351 --> 20:01.684
West of here. I met him in Bingo Mihara.

20:01.788 --> 20:06.418
That's right, by now, he could be
somewhere around the Aki territories...

20:09.996 --> 20:12.658
He was just like a cloud, that man...

20:18.204 --> 20:20.297
Thank you so much for taking care of me.

20:21.541 --> 20:22.371
Take care of yourself.

20:36.456 --> 20:37.582
Yakumo...

21:18.431 --> 21:21.423
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.578 --> 21:44.615
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:44.891 --> 21:54.630
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.767 --> 22:03.766
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:03.910 --> 22:14.582
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.621 --> 22:21.753
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:22.128 --> 22:25.120
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:25.998 --> 22:32.267
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.572 --> 22:38.067
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.825 --> 22:56.818
Shiori and Yakumo are reunited at last
under the cherry trees in full bloom.

22:57.196 --> 23:00.563
But here in this land, there
are men who lust for power.

23:01.334 --> 23:04.269
Next episode of the
Age of Chaos, "Reunion."

23:04.570 --> 23:06.197
Pay close attention, and wait!
